text = "[ul]
Use arrow keys or WASD to move
Collect the key to unlock the exit to each level
The distance to the key or the exit is shown in the bottom left - keep an eye on this, it'll be helpful
The countdown to the next shift is shown in the bottom right
[/ul]"
fit_content = true

